  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to provide support for GoSL to make an informeddecision regarding geothermal explorati on and development in Saint Lucia by undertaking keyupstream preparatory activities. Such support would help the GoSL confirm area s for drilling,partner with a qualified developer, and design a geothermal exploration/resource confirmationprogram for sustaina ble implementation &#x2013; all in line with good industry practices andinternational standards.</narrative>
  </description>
